      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Triangular Dy3 SMT/SMM with toroidal magnetic moment. χmT(300 K)=40.53 cm3 K mol−1 (vs 42.51 expected for 3 Dy(III)); decreases to 1.07 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. M(2 K, 7 T)=15.61 Nβ with low-field inflection ~6 kOe and hysteresis step at H=0.6 T. Zero-field ac χ″ frequency dependence below ~36 K; Cole–Cole Debye fits give Ueff=130 K and τ0=2.8×10−7 s (highest reported among triangular Dy3 SMTs). CASSCF/SINGLE_ANISO supports suppressed ground-state QTM.",
